        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 246.21,
          "end": 249.86,
          "en": "We do this with the onPress prop, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 249.86,
          "end": 251.97,
          "en": "And then here, we wanna define",
