        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 268.88,
          "end": 271.65,
          "en": "a brand new onPress prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 271.65,
          "end": 272.83,
          "en": "though this name is up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 272.83,
          "end": 275.09000000000003,
          "en": "because it's your component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 275.09000000000003,
          "end": 279.93,
          "en": "and forward this to the onPress prop of pressable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 279.93,
          "end": 281.628,
          "en": "so that I expect to get a pointer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 281.628,
          "end": 285.01,
          "en": "at a function on this onPress prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 285.01,
          "end": 287.90999999999997,
          "en": "So on this onPress prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 287.90999999999997,
          "end": 291.84000000000003,
          "en": "and then I use this onPress prop down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 291.84000000000003,
          "end": 295.3,
          "en": "And whenever this onPress prop here is fired,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 295.3,
          "end": 297.39,
          "en": "then this function which we receive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 297.39,
          "end": 301.96,
          "en": "on this onPress prop will be executed on our behalf.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 301.96,
          "end": 303.75,
          "en": "That means that now in the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 303.75,
          "end": 306.62,
          "en": "where we use the CategoryGridTile,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 306.62,
          "end": 310.26,
          "en": "which is this CategoriesScreen component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 310.26,
          "end": 311.93,
          "en": "there we now have to decide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 311.93,
          "end": 313.633,
          "en": "what should happen upon a press.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 314.55,
          "end": 315.383,
          "en": "So if we're here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 315.383,
          "end": 318.42,
          "en": "I'll add this onPress prop, which we just added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 318.42,
          "end": 319.85,
          "en": "If you chose a different name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 319.85,
          "end": 322.98,
          "en": "you have to use a different name here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 322.98,
          "end": 325.24,
          "en": "And then here I'll add a new function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 325.24,
          "end": 328,
          "en": "the pressHandler, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 328,
          "end": 330.363,
          "en": "and I'll point at this function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 332.46,
          "end": 335,
          "en": "But what should happen inside of pressHandler now?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 335,
          "end": 337.83,
          "en": "Well here, we want to navigate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 337.83,
          "end": 341.68,
          "en": "and React Navigation gives us tools for doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 341.68,
          "end": 344.73,
          "en": "Most importantly, in a screen component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 344.73,
          "end": 349.02,
          "en": "so in a component that bound to a screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 349.02,
          "end": 353.39,
          "en": "as CategoriesScreen and MealsOverviewScreen are,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 353.39,
          "end": 357,
          "en": "they are bound to screens through Stack.Screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 357,
          "end": 359.23,
          "en": "So in components that are set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 359.23,
          "end": 363.91,
          "en": "as components here on such Stack.Screen components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 363.91,
          "end": 367.42,
          "en": "in those components, you get a special prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 367.42,
          "end": 369.713,
          "en": "provided by React Navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 370.83,
          "end": 372.96,
          "en": "You get a special prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 372.96,
          "end": 374.42,
          "en": "which you can pull out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
